invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.h
catches: proof/prove-one.sh quic_config_webpki
reason: hspost_ticket_age_ok ignores the lifetime the caller gave and holds
  every age to seven days alone, so a ticket past a shorter lifetime is
  offered, which RFC 9846 section 4.3.11.1 forbids a client. The
  quic_config_webpki harness requires CH_OK only for an age at or below
  the lifetime, over any age and any lifetime.

--- old
    if (cfg->ticket_lifetime_s != 0 && cfg->ticket_lifetime_s < lifetime_s) {
--- new
    if (0) {
